<title>THAILAND: Cogeneration Q3 net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Cogeneration Q3 net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1997			  1996</p>
<p>					Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		0.70	vs		0.57</p>
<p>    Net		     187.73	vs	    152.07</p>
<p>					Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		1.99	vs		0.99</p>
<p>    Net		     529.83	vs	    237.83</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited. Cogeneration Plc is a power producer.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
